#if(v_ch3_tactics == 3) {
I weigh the options in my head before meeting Daren's eyes.

"I want to focus on helping the two of you by observing the battlefield and providing tactical information."

"A sound choice," Daren says, nodding in approval. "Observation and hearing as your primary channels. But don't neglect your defenses. If the enemy catches you standing idle and calling out formations, they'll target you first, just like yesterday. You need toughness, reflexes, or premonition in reserve. Kate and I won't always be in position to shield you."

Daren turns toward Kate.

"As for our pairing. After that enchanter and his sons yesterday, I'd rather not lock swords with weapon enchanters unless there's no way around it. When we run into them, they're yours."

