"When you and Daren first saw me, you whispered between yourselves for nearly a full minute. You made that pathetic joke about making a pass at me to throw me off balance, and I let it pass. But an entire day went by, and neither of you uttered a single word about banshees. Not even after that enchanter shouted it across the clearing during our battle. You two were debating whether I was a monster, and you decided against purification."

