choice("Continue", Ch3-Decide-Alive, v_current_scene = Ch3-Decide-Alive) if (v_ch3_saved_from_dart == 0 && v_is_dead == 0 && v_combat_technique >= 2 || v_ch3_saved_from_dart == 0 && v_is_dead == 0 && v_reflexes >= 2)


ID: Ch3-Second-Kill
TEXT:

set(v_is_dead,0) if (v_combat_technique >= 1 && v_reflexes >= 1 || v_combat_technique == 0 && v_agility >= 1 && v_reflexes >= 1 || v_reflexes == 0 && v_toughness == 3 && v_combat_technique >= 1 || v_combat_technique == 0 && v_reflexes == 0 && v_toughness == 3 && v_agility >= 1)
set(v_is_dead,1) if (v_reflexes == 0 && v_toughness < 3 || v_agility == 0 && v_combat_technique == 0 && v_reflexes >= 1 || v_agility == 0 && v_combat_technique == 0 && v_reflexes == 0 && v_toughness == 3)
#if(v_combat_technique >= 1 && v_reflexes >= 1) {

I snatch the crossbow from the dirt and step directly into their path, firing straight into the center man's forehead. Before his body hits the needles, I crank the lever and put a second bolt through his partner's throat. As both drop lifeless, I duck behind a thick pine while three bolts splinter the bark.

Three shots remaining.

I lean out from cover. The remaining three have scattered behind nearby trunks. A mercenary steps out to line up a shot on my chest, but my heightened reflexes let me sidestep the incoming bolt.

I put an iron tip through his heart before he can retract his head. A fourth man breaks cover to sprint for a flanking angle; my next shot catches him in the gut, dropping him mid-stride.

The final mercenary crouches behind a birch thirty paces out. I don't give him time to reload. I take aim and loose my last bolt, driving it through his temple and splattering the pale bark with crimson.

Five dead.

}
#if(v_combat_technique == 0 && v_agility >= 1 && v_reflexes >= 1) {

I snatch the crossbow from the dirt and step directly into their path, firing straight into the center man's forehead. Before his body hits the needles, I crank the lever and put a second bolt through his partner's throat. As both drop lifeless, I duck behind a thick pine while three bolts splinter the bark.

Three shots remaining.

I lean out from cover. The remaining three have scattered behind nearby trunks. A mercenary steps out to line up a shot on my chest, but my heightened reflexes let me sidestep the incoming bolt.

I put an iron tip through his heart before he can retract his head. A fourth man breaks cover to sprint for a flanking angle; my next shot catches him in the gut, dropping him mid-stride.

The final mercenary stands behind a birch thirty paces out. I take aim and pull the trigger—the bolt grazes his shoulder and embeds in the wood. Empty.

No time to reload. I surge forward with blinding speed, closing the thirty-yard gap in seconds with the ice dagger raised.

The man fumbles his crossbow in panic, unable to track my rush. Before he can level the sights, I drive the frost blade deep into the side of his neck, drenching my hand in hot blood.

Five dead.

}
#if(v_reflexes == 0 && v_toughness == 3 && v_combat_technique >= 1) {

I snatch the crossbow from the dirt and step directly into their path, firing straight into the center man's forehead. Before his body hits the needles, I crank the lever and put a second bolt through his partner's throat. As both drop lifeless, I duck behind a thick pine while three bolts splinter the bark.

Three shots remaining.

I step out to acquire the remaining targets. A mercenary pops out from behind a trunk and fires into my chest.

I cannot dodge in time, but the bolt strikes the reinforced muscle of my sternum, biting into the flesh without penetrating deep enough to puncture the ribcage.

I wrench the bolt free and put a shot through the attacker's heart. I catch the fourth man in the abdomen as he lunges forward, dropping him instantly.

The final mercenary attempts to flee behind a birch tree. I level the iron sights and loose my last bolt, drilling through his temple.

Five dead.

}
#if(v_combat_technique == 0 && v_reflexes == 0 && v_toughness == 3 && v_agility >= 1) {

I snatch the crossbow from the dirt and step directly into their path, firing straight into the center man's forehead. Before his body hits the needles, I crank the lever and put a second bolt through his partner's throat. As both drop lifeless, I duck behind a thick pine while three bolts splinter the bark.

Three shots remaining.

I step out to acquire the remaining targets. A mercenary pops out from behind a trunk and fires into my chest.

I cannot dodge in time, but the bolt strikes the reinforced muscle of my sternum, biting into the flesh without penetrating deep enough to puncture the ribcage.

I wrench the bolt free and put a shot through the attacker's heart. I catch the fourth man in the abdomen as he lunges forward, dropping him instantly.

The final mercenary attempts to flee. I fire my last bolt, but the shot goes wide.

With the magazine dry, I sprint forward on amplified legs, covering the ground before he can turn. I drive the ice dagger through his throat, killing him on the spot.

Five dead.

}
#if(v_reflexes == 0 && v_toughness < 3) {

I snatch the crossbow from the dirt and step directly into their path, firing straight into the center man's forehead. Before his body hits the needles, I crank the lever and put a second bolt through his partner's throat. As both drop lifeless, I duck behind a thick pine while three bolts splinter the bark.

Three shots remaining.

I step out from behind the trunk. A mercenary steps out from cover and fires point-blank into my chest.

Without reflexes to dodge or toughness to absorb the impact, the steel bolt punches straight through my heart, killing me before I hit the ground.

}
#if(v_agility == 0 && v_combat_technique == 0 && v_reflexes >= 1) {

I snatch the crossbow from the dirt and step directly into their path, firing straight into the center man's forehead. Before his body hits the needles, I crank the lever and put a second bolt through his partner's throat. As both drop lifeless, I duck behind a thick pine while three bolts splinter the bark.

Three shots remaining.

I lean out from cover, dodging an incoming bolt, and shoot the third man through the heart. I drop the fourth with a gut shot.

I take aim at the final mercenary, but my last shot goes wide. I draw the ice dagger and charge.

Without agility to close the distance quickly, I am an easy target. The mercenary calmly levels his crossbow and drives a bolt through my face, killing me instantly.

}
#if(v_agility == 0 && v_combat_technique == 0 && v_reflexes == 0 && v_toughness == 3) {

I snatch the crossbow from the dirt and step directly into their path, firing straight into the center man's forehead. Before his body hits the needles, I crank the lever and put a second bolt through his partner's throat. As both drop lifeless, I duck behind a thick pine while three bolts splinter the bark.

Three shots remaining.

A bolt hits my chest, but my enhanced toughness stops it from piercing deep. I rip the bolt out, kill the attacker, and shoot the fourth in the stomach.

I fire my last bolt at the fifth man and miss. I charge him with the ice dagger.

Without agility to close the distance quickly, I am an easy target. The mercenary calmly levels his crossbow and drives a bolt through my face, killing me instantly.

}
