ID: Ch3-Move-second
TEXT:

set(v_is_dead,1) if (v_combat_technique < 3)
set(v_is_dead,0) if (v_combat_technique == 3)
#if(v_combat_technique < 3) {

I keep my boots moving, weaving between trunks while firing the repeating crossbow on the run.

My bolts fly wild into the dark. Without advanced technique to manage firing angles, the mercenaries exploit their numbers, spreading wide to surround my position.

Trapped in a dead end between two boulders, ten crossbows fire simultaneously. A volley of steel bolts shreds my chest, killing me instantly.

}
#if(v_combat_technique == 3) {

I keep my boots moving, weaving between trunks while firing the repeating crossbow on the run.

Ten against one. Running blind invites a crossfire, but advanced combat technique turns the terrain into armor. I track the position of every hostile in the grove, calculating angles of approach to keep tree trunks between myself and their main firing lanes. By managing their collective blind spots, I ensure no more than two mercenaries can line up a shot at any given second.

}
choice("Restart game", Ch1-Intro1, v_current_scene = Ch1-Intro1, special:restart) if (v_combat_technique < 3)
