ID: Ch3-Snipe-second
TEXT:

set(v_is_dead,1) if (v_perception < 3)
set(v_is_dead,0) if (v_perception == 3)
#if(v_perception < 3) {

I pull back into the deep woods, trying to leverage distance.

My shots continue to miss in the gloom. While I fumble with the magazine, a mercenary slips around my flank unspotted. A heavy blade drives between my shoulder blades, dropping me to the frozen dirt. The mercenary stands over me, raising his sword for the finishing strike.

}
#if(v_perception == 3) {

I pull back into the deep woods, letting distance work in my favor.

Even in the deep darkness under the pines, every contour of their leather armor stands out sharply. Landing center-mass shots is as straightforward as target practice.

}
choice("Restart game", Ch1-Intro1, v_current_scene = Ch1-Intro1, special:restart) if (v_perception < 3)
