ID: Ch3-Speed2
TEXT:

set(v_is_dead,1) if (v_ch3_prioritize == 1)
set(v_is_dead,0) if (v_ch3_prioritize == 2 || v_ch3_prioritize == 3 || v_ch3_prioritize == 4)
#if(v_ch3_prioritize == 1) {
I snap a heavy oak limb from a fallen trunk, holding the ice dagger in reserve.

I sprint behind the two scouts investigating my diversion.

In a heartbeat, I smash the oak branch into the first scout's skull, dropping him instantly. Before the second can turn, a strike to his temple puts him on the ground beside his partner.

I slip behind another trunk, stalking the remaining three. They advance cautiously toward my decoy thwacks.

I lunge from the shadows, cracking the skulls of the first two. The third man parries my swing with his crossbow stock, leveling the barrel at my stomach.

I slash his wrist with the ice dagger, knocking the weapon loose. I swing the club again, but he catches my forearm in an iron grip, twisting until the bone snaps. The white-hot pain shatters my focus. His hunting knife plunges into my stomach.

I stumble to my knees. The mercenary retrieves his crossbow, leveling the iron sights at my face with a sneer.

"Out of your league, boy."

He pulls the trigger. Darkness takes me.

}
#if(v_ch3_prioritize == 2) {
I snap a heavy oak limb from a fallen trunk, holding the ice dagger in reserve.

I sprint behind the two scouts investigating my diversion.

In a heartbeat, I smash the oak branch into the first scout's skull, dropping him instantly. Before the second can turn, a strike to his temple puts him on the ground beside his partner.

I slip behind another trunk, stalking the remaining three. They advance cautiously toward my decoy thwacks.

I lunge from the shadows, cracking the skulls of the first two. The third man parries my swing with his crossbow stock, leveling the barrel at my stomach.

I slash his wrist with the ice dagger, knocking the weapon loose. He draws a combat blade with his off-hand.

No more holding back. I duck beneath his slash, driving the ice dagger deep into his jugular. Blood sprays across the moss as he collapses, clawing at his throat until he lies still.

Two reinforcements rush the noise. I circle behind them in a blur of speed, cutting their throats before they can raise their weapons.

The final man drops his crossbow and flees in terror into the night.

I let him go. His will is broken.

}
#if(v_ch3_prioritize == 3) {
I target the splinter group from the shadows.

In a heartbeat, I close the distance and drive the ice dagger through the base of the first man's skull. Before the second can register the sound, I open his throat and fade behind a pine.

The remaining three advance toward the noise.

I strike from behind, killing two in rapid succession. The third parries my swing and levels his crossbow.

I slash his wrist, sending the weapon flying, and drive the blade into his chest before he can draw his knife.

Two reinforcements rush the noise. I circle behind them in a blur of speed, cutting their throats before they can raise their weapons.

The final man drops his crossbow and flees in terror into the night.

I let him go. His will is broken.

}
#if(v_ch3_prioritize == 4) {
I target the splinter group from the shadows.

In a heartbeat, I close the distance and drive the ice dagger through the base of the first man's skull. Before the second can register the sound, I open his throat and fade behind a pine.

The remaining three advance toward the noise.

I strike from behind, killing two in rapid succession. The third parries my swing and levels his crossbow.

I slash his wrist, sending the weapon flying, and drive the blade into his chest before he can draw his knife.

Two reinforcements rush the noise. I circle behind them in a blur of speed, cutting their throats before they can raise their weapons.

The final man turns and bolts through the brush.

I raise the repeating crossbow and fire—the bolt punches through the back of his skull, killing him instantly.

}
choice("Restart game", Ch1-Intro1, v_current_scene = Ch1-Intro1, special:restart) if (v_ch3_prioritize == 1)
choice("Load from last checkpoint", , v_chapter_save_counter = 5, special:checkpoint_load) if (v_ch3_prioritize == 1)
choice("Load game", , , special:saves) if (v_ch3_prioritize == 1)
