ID: Ch3-Move-crossbowmen
TEXT:

set(v_ch3_bloodied,0) if (v_ch3_prioritize < 4)
set(v_ch3_bloodied,1) if (v_ch3_prioritize == 4)
#if(v_ch3_prioritize < 4) {
Direct assault carries too much risk. I adjust my approach, using the trees to break line of sight.

I move deliberately through the perimeter, splitting larger squads with noise decoys and picking them off methodically as they lose cohesion.

As their ranks thin, panic spreads. The mercenaries break formation, abandoning their posts and scattering into the dark woods. They have no discipline; against seasoned legionnaires, this would have ended very differently.

}
#if(v_ch3_prioritize == 4) {
Direct assault carries too much risk. I adjust my approach, using the trees to break line of sight.

I move deliberately through the perimeter, splitting larger squads with noise decoys and picking them off methodically as they lose cohesion.

As their ranks thin, panic spreads. The mercenaries break formation, abandoning their posts and scattering into the dark woods.

Hunting down every fleeing mercenary across dense forest takes time, however. By the time I eliminate the final runner, Kate has taken several grazing bolts through her defenses. She is bloodied, but still on her feet.

}
choice("Continue", Ch3-Crossbowmen-finish, v_current_scene = Ch3-Crossbowmen-finish)


